<?xml version="1.0"?>
<rdf:RDF xmlns="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#"
     xml:base="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3"
     xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#"
     xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#"
     xmlns:xml="http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace"
     xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#"
     xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#"
     xmlns:swrl="http://www.w3.org/2003/11/swrl#"
     xmlns:swrla="http://swrl.stanford.edu/ontologies/3.3/swrla.owl#">
    <owl:Ontology rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3"/>



    <!--
    ///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
    //
    // Object Properties
    //
    ///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
     -->




    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#제한하다 -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#제한하다">
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">제한하다</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">limits</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:comment>조문이 법적 개념(행위·용어)의 범위·기준을 제한함.
            Neo4j: LIMITS (Provision → LegalTerm).
            활용처: get_delegation_limits (SWRL Rule 1 위임 상속), legal_checker 용어 제한 범위 검증.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#조"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#법적개념"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>



    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#인용하다 -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#인용하다">
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">인용하다</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">references</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:comment>조문이 다른 조문을 인용·참조함.
            Neo4j: REFERENCES (Provision → Provision).
            활용처: 조문 간 인용 체계 파악, 법령 개정 영향 추적.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#조"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#조"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>



    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#집행하다 -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#집행하다">
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">집행하다</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">enforces</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:comment>조례가 상위법률의 집행 근거로 지정됨.
            Neo4j: ENFORCES (Ordinance → Statute).
            역관계: 집행근거를_가지다 (isEnforcedBy).
            활용처: 법령 집행 체계 파악.</rdfs:comment>
        <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#집행근거를_가지다"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#조례"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#상위법률"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>



    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#집행근거를_가지다 -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#집행근거를_가지다">
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">집행근거를_가지다</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">isEnforcedBy</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:comment>상위법률이 특정 조례에 의해 집행됨 (집행하다의 역관계).
            Neo4j: 직접 매핑 없음 (ENFORCES 역방향 탐색).
            활용처: 상위법이 어느 조례로 집행되는지 역방향 조회.</rdfs:comment>
        <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#집행하다"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#상위법률"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#조례"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>



    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#제재하다 -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#제재하다">
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">제재하다</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">penalizes</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:comment>벌칙 조항이 위반 행위 대상 조항을 제재함.
            Neo4j: PENALIZES (Provision → Provision).
            활용처: get_penalty_chain (직접 벌칙), get_penalty_extension (SWRL Rule 4 2단계 벌칙 범위 확장).</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#조"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#조"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>



    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#우위에_있다 -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#우위에_있다">
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">우위에_있다</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">isSuperiorTo</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:comment>상위법률이 조례보다 법적 위계가 높음 (전이적: 헌법 > 법률 > 시행령 > 조례).
            Neo4j: SUPERIOR_TO (Statute → Ordinance).
            역관계: 하위에_있다 (inferiorTo).
            활용처: get_superior_statute_provisions, get_hierarchy_chain (SWRL Rule 2 위계 전이성).</rdfs:comment>
        <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#하위에_있다"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#상위법률"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#조례"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>



    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#하위에_있다 -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#하위에_있다">
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">하위에_있다</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">inferiorTo</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:comment>조례가 상위법률보다 법적 위계가 낮음 (우위에_있다의 역관계).
            Neo4j: 직접 매핑 없음 (SUPERIOR_TO 역방향 탐색).
            활용처: 조례가 어느 상위법 아래에 위치하는지 역방향 조회.</rdfs:comment>
        <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#우위에_있다"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#조례"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#상위법률"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>



    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#유사하다 -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#유사하다">
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">유사하다</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">isSimilarTo</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:comment>지자체 조례 간 내용적 유사성 (대칭 관계).
            Neo4j: SIMILAR_TO (Ordinance ↔ Ordinance, 양방향).
            활용처: find_similar_ordinances, 타 지자체 조례 참고 제공.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#조례"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#조례"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>



    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#상충하다 -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#상충하다">
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">상충하다</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">conflictsWith</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:comment>조례가 상위법률과 규정 내용이 충돌함.
            Neo4j: CONFLICTS_WITH (Ordinance → Statute).
            활용처: legal_checker 충돌 감지, get_conflict_chain (SWRL Rule 3 충돌 연쇄 감지).</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#조례"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#상위법률"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>



    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#수행주체이다 -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#수행주체이다">
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">수행주체이다</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">hasAgent</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:comment>법적 행위의 권리 주체를 지정함.
            Neo4j: 직접 매핑 관계 없음 (앱 미사용).
            활용처: 법적 행위 주체 추론 (향후 확장 예정).</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#법적행위"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#권리주체"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>



    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#위임근거를_가지다 -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#위임근거를_가지다">
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">위임근거를_가지다</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">hasLegalBasis</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:comment>조례가 상위법률로부터 위임받은 근거를 보유함 (위임하다의 역관계).
            Neo4j: BASED_ON (Ordinance → Statute).
            활용처: graph_retriever Phase 2 BASED_ON 경로 탐색.</rdfs:comment>
        <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#위임하다"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#조례"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#상위법률"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>



    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#위임하다 -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#위임하다">
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">위임하다</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">delegates</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:comment>상위법률이 조례 제정 권한을 위임함.
            Neo4j: DELEGATES (Statute → Ordinance).
            역관계: 위임근거를_가지다 (hasLegalBasis).
            활용처: graph_retriever Phase 1 최우선 탐색, get_delegation_limits (SWRL Rule 1 위임 상속).</rdfs:comment>
        <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#위임근거를_가지다"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#상위법률"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#조례"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>



    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#정의하다 -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#정의하다">
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">정의하다</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">defines</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:comment>조문구조가 법적 개념(용어)을 공식 정의함.
            Neo4j: DEFINES (Statute → LegalTerm).
            활용처: find_legal_terms, 법령 용어 정의 검색.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#조문구조"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#법적개념"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>



    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#준용하다 -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#준용하다">
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">준용하다</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">appliesByAnalogy</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:comment>조례가 상위법률의 규정을 준용·유추 적용함.
            Neo4j: APPLIES_BY_ANALOGY (Ordinance → Statute).
            활용처: get_analogy_applications, 유추 적용 법령 근거 보강.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#조례"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#상위법률"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>



    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#포함하다 -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#포함하다">
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">포함하다</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">contains</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:comment>조문구조 상위 요소가 하위 요소를 포함함 (전이적: 장>조>항>호>목).
            Neo4j: CONTAINS (Statute/Ordinance → Provision).
            활용처: get_delegation_limits 3홉 경로 (DELEGATES→CONTAINS→LIMITS).</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#조문구조"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#조문구조"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>



    <!--
    ///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
    //
    // Transitive Object Properties
    //
    ///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
     -->


    <!-- 우위에_있다 — 법적 위계 전이성: 헌법 > 법률 > 시행령 > 조례 -->
    <owl:TransitiveObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#우위에_있다"/>

    <!-- 포함하다 — 조문구조 포함 전이성: Statute > Provision > Paragraph > Item > SubItem -->
    <owl:TransitiveObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#포함하다"/>


    <!--
    ///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
    //
    // Data properties
    //
    ///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
     -->




    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#법적효력일 -->

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#법적효력일">
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime"/>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>



    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#조문 -->

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#조문">
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>



    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#조문번호 -->

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#조문번호">
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"/>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>



    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#조문제목 -->

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#조문제목">
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>



    <!--
    ///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
    //
    // Classes
    //
    ///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
     -->




    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#객체 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#객체">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#법적개념"/>
    </owl:Class>



    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#권리주체 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#권리주체">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#법적개념"/>
    </owl:Class>



    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#규칙 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#규칙">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#자치법규"/>
    </owl:Class>



    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#목 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#목">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#호"/>
    </owl:Class>



    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#법규범 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#법규범"/>



    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#법적개념 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2026/2/untitled-ontology-3#법적개념"/>



